# Pinned standalone tools: one KEY=value per line, no spaces, no quotes.
# Sourced by scripts/ci/*.sh. scripts/ci/install-tools.sh installs the binaries
# into the repository bin/ and verifies each download against the SHA-256 below,
# copied from the release's published checksums (shellcheck publishes none: its
# values equal the asset digests GitHub reports for the release).
# Node, pnpm and JavaScript tools follow frontend/package.json; Go modules follow
# backend/go.mod.
#
# Updating a tool: change its version and all four SHA-256 values in one commit,
# run scripts/ci/install-tools.sh <tool>, then scripts/ci/t0.sh.

